{
  "id": "HOS.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "HOS",
  "reference": "Hosea 6",
  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come, and let us return unto Jehovah; for he hath torn, and he will heal us; he hath smitten, and he will bind us up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After two days will he revive us: on the third day he will raise us up, and we shall live before him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And let us know, let us follow on to know Jehovah: his going forth is sure as the morning; and he will come unto us as the rain, as the latter rain that watereth the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Ephraim, what shall I do unto thee? O Judah, what shall I do unto thee? for your goodness is as a morning cloud, and as the dew that goeth early away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore have I hewed them by the prophets; I have slain them by the words of my mouth: and thy judgments are ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the light that goeth forth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I desire goodness, and not sacrifice; and the knowledge of God more than burnt-offerings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they like Adam have transgressed the covenant: there have they dealt treacherously against me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilead is a city of them that work iniquity; it is stained with blood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as troops of robbers wait for a man, so the company of priests murder in the way toward Shechem; yea, they have committed lewdness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the house of Israel I have seen a horrible thing: there whoredom is ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in Ephraim, Israel is defiled. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also, O Judah, there is a harvest appointed for thee, when I bring back the captivity of my people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
